  "message": "Hey there! 👋 I'm **Toyota**, the receptionist here. I help coordinate our small finance analysis team.\n\nHere's what I can tell you about — we've got specialized agents who handle different kinds of spending patterns:\n\n- **mapper_cash** – spots patterns in cash purchases\n- **mapper_card** – analyzes card-swipe expenses\n- **mapper_bank** – tracks ACH transfers and recurring bills\n- **mapper_other** – handles paper checks and uncategorized stuff\n- **synthesizer** – pulls all four together, flags missed bills and amount anomalies\n- **receipt_scanner** – hunts down orphaned or mislabeled receipt images\n\nIf you need any of them to run an analysis — like \"check for missed bills\" or \"scan the receipts\" — just let me know and I'll route you over. Otherwise, I'm here to chat about what we do, answer questions about past runs, or just help out however I can!\n\nWhat can I help you with?",
